  ],
  "notes": "Chamber temperature is documented only for the variants (20, 30, 35 C); the baseline chamber temperature is not stated. cycleNumber is unreliable (the authors merged tester output files); VAHxx_impedance.csv holds pulse resistances at 20% and 60% SOC. Cell spec from Murata's official US18650VTC6 product datasheet. Charge/discharge rate estimates, where explicitly marked raw_data in the citations, use signed observed current extrema divided by the stored nominal Ah. These are measurement estimates over the cached extraction scope, not imposed CC protocol setpoints; they may include pulse, dynamic, regenerative or diagnostic segments and measurement excursions. Current units and direction were checked against the cited original headers, status labels or separate charge/discharge counters. cached ranges cover 22 cell files, including mission and capacity-test segments; the maximum discharge value was independently located in VAH01.csv. The discharge maximum was traced to the mission segment ending at 2.5001111 V, with preceding increasing discharge currents; it is not a fixed-current discharge."
 },
